  "summary": "Record provisional literature-grounded Fe-FT reference conditions and the scoped Fe(110) TS illustration.",
  "payload": {
    "markdown": "- Phase 3.2.3.2 adopted a provisional 523 K, 2.5 MPa syngas comparison point with nominal H2/CO of 2. Source: Fe5C2(510) model and industrial context. At 523 K the reviewed local Fe(110) TS has a conditional harmonic correction of +0.27948341 eV. Both endpoints still lack comparable thermal evidence and the Fe MKM gate remains blocked. See reports/multiphase/phase3_2_3_2/completion.md."
